    "text": "Let $R(G;k)$ denote the minimal $m$ such that if the edges of $K_m$ are $k$-coloured then there is a monochromatic copy of $G$. Determine $ R(K_{s,t};k) $ where $K_{s,t}$ is the complete bipartite graph with $s$ vertices in one component and $t$ in the other.",
